Data
----

Timetable data comes from the sources chosen in the settings (VBB, BVG REST,
public-transport-enabler, Transitous); their attributions are shown in the app.
Transitous lists its data sources at https://transitous.org/sources/.
Change positions: vbb-change-positions, ODbL. Map and station data: © OpenStreetMap
contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright); map tiles: OpenFreeMap.
